error[R0606] (conservative): the comparison is inside the `type` call
--> 10:13: `type` receives the comparison's boolean result, not the value
  = note: `type(x == "number")` always answers "boolean" — the intended check compares the call's RESULT to the string
  = note: valid Luau — but taking the type of a comparison result is almost never what was meant
  = help: move the comparison outside: `(type(value) == "number")`
          (type(value) == "number")
